      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Teeth_Gun_0e49ef0",
      "source": "Doctor: А ты сейчас человека убьёшь...",
      "target": "Doctor: Most pedig meg fogsz ölni egy embert...",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-400.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13266,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452962721793",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Teeth_Gun_0c32df3",
      "source": "Doctor: Ты делаешь ошибку, я людей лечу!",
      "target": "Doctor: Hibát követsz el, én embereket gyógyítok!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-400.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13267,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452962721792",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Teeth_Gun_0918b08",
      "source": "Doctor: Подожди, что?",
      "target": "Doctor: Várj, mi?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-400.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
