      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Eyes_0ea4662",
      "source": "Doctor: Но... увы.",
      "target": "Doctor: De… sajnos.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-401.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13289,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138885",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Eyes_0994744",
      "source": "Doctor: Казалось бы, два зрачка в одном глазу - как удобно!",
      "target": "Doctor: Azt hinnéd, két pupilla egy szemben milyen hasznos!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-401.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13290,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138884",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Eyes_03b4b4a",
      "source": "Doctor: Я хуже из-за этого вижу.",
      "target": "Doctor: Pedig emiatt rosszabbul látok.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-401.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13291,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138883",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Eyes_03acf9f",
      "source": "Doctor: ...",
      "target": "Doctor: ...",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-039.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13292,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138882",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Eyes_024d460",
      "source": "Doctor: Вот что это значит.",
      "target": "Doctor: Ezt jelenti.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-401.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13293,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138881",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Eyes_00306a5",
      "source": "Doctor: Не знаю, заметил ты или нет, но у меня поликория.",
      "target": "Doctor: Nem tudom, észrevetted-e, de polikóriám van.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-401.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13294,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138880",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Eyes_057f2d9",
      "source": "Doctor: Хах, да, я покажу тебе свои глаза.",
      "target": "Doctor: Haha, igen, megmutatom a szememet.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-401.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13295,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452945944580",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Hands_0a1fc77",
