      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Teeth_0df1c26",
      "source": "Отпустить",
      "target": "Elengedés",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13305,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452941750274",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Teeth_0057289",
      "source": "Doctor: Интересно, как он сейчас?",
      "target": "Doctor: Kíváncsi vagyok, hogy lehet most?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-401.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13306,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452941750273",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Teeth_05e183d",
      "source": "Doctor: А я его как-то прооперировал недавно.",
      "target": "Doctor: Nemrég én is megoperáltam őt egyszer.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-401.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13307,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452941750272",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Teeth_07841a6",
      "source": "Doctor: Мне друг по знакомству бесплатно такие поставил.",
      "target": "Doctor: Ezeket egy barátom tette be nekem ingyen, szívességből.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-401.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13308,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452937555976",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Teeth_0ad5afc",
      "source": "Doctor: Идеальные, да?",
      "target": "Doctor: Tökéletesek, ugye?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-401.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13309,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452937555975",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Doctor_Teeth_03520dd",
